{"about":["High speed and stylish driving! That's what it takes to become the ultimate Ridge Racer! The extremely popular PS® game R4 RIDGE RACER TYPE 4 marks its return on PS4® and PS5®! It is named R4 to indicate the fourth entry in the Ridge Racer series. The basic gameplay follows the concept of the Ridge Racer series, a racing game where everyone can enjoy the excitement of high-speed control. In the main game mode, players will be able to experience the life of a racer.","*Bonus Discs (Ridge Racer - High Spec Ver. and Namco Catalogue '98) are not included. *Jogcon and NeGcon are not supported."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/0909/b26c04e054838ce8f49e50fa6c61a98159994a9849baa24b.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/0909/b26c04e054838ce8f49e50fa6c61a98159994a9849baa24b.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/0909/b8a14530536dab6ba998dc4a143373431ea173fc8cb57843.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/0909/b8a14530536dab6ba998dc4a143373431ea173fc8cb57843.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/0909/e66b8958b3907df65ebe8cc9062066d388cca8bc26e7b9fe.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/0909/e66b8958b3907df65ebe8cc9062066d388cca8bc26e7b9fe.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/0909/6ec057c2b71aa1bcd6cc6f41dcfd40ac048e504ddb43e84e.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/0909/6ec057c2b71aa1bcd6cc6f41dcfd40ac048e504ddb43e84e.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/0909/b1de2ad6f89d17fcba05ddb0e79e6153cd9aec8c2a3b4e73.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/0909/b1de2ad6f89d17fcba05ddb0e79e6153cd9aec8c